    {
      "Id": 2004801002,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2004801,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 2,
      "SpeakerName": "银河座团员们",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "谢谢指导！",
      "VoiceFileName": "20048010020",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2004801003,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2004801,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 3,
      "SpeakerName": "克莱尔",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "辛苦了，拉莫娜老师。/n今天也很热闹呢。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20048010030",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2004801004,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2004801,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 4,
      "SpeakerName": "拉莫娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "喂喂，别叫我老师啦。/n参加的人变多了，也因此稍微引来了些关注，这点倒让我有些在意。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20048010040",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 105,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 12,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 30203,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "302"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2004801005,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2004801,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 5,
      "SpeakerName": "阿比盖尔",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "明明是演员，却是会在意别人目光的类型？",
      "VoiceFileName": "20048010050",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2004801006,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2004801,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 6,
      "SpeakerName": "拉莫娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "不是那回事。只是我觉得，没必要轻率地引人注目。/n人聚得越多，想法也就越多。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20048010060",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 71,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 15,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 30203,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "302"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2004801007,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2004801,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 7,
      "SpeakerName": "克莱尔",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "啊……。/n毕竟也有人并不赞同这个工作坊。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20048010070",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2004801008,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2004801,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 8,
      "SpeakerName": "阿比盖尔",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "不过啊～，不是已经慢慢扎下根了吗？/n新人们都很期待这次会是谁来当讲师哦。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20048010080",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2004801009,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2004801,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 9,
      "SpeakerName": "拉莫娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "这也多亏你们帮忙宣传。/n我很感谢。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20048010090",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 200,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 11,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 30203,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "302"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2004801010,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2004801,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 10,
      "SpeakerName": "阿比盖尔",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "不是，教人的一方道什么谢啊？/n这话应该我们来说才对～。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20048010100",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2004801011,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2004801,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 11,
      "SpeakerName": "拉莫娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "哈哈，我说的是真心话。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20048010110",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 103,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 15,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 30203,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "302"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2004801012,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2004801,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 12,
      "SpeakerName": "克莱尔",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "说什么呢。/n《麦克白》的时候，你不也是为新人着想才站出来发声的吗？",
      "VoiceFileName": "20048010120",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2004801013,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2004801,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 13,
      "SpeakerName": "阿比盖尔",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "就是就是。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20048010130",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2004801014,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2004801,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 14,
      "SpeakerName": "克莱尔",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "大家多少都感到过不安。/n真正应该道谢的是我们。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20048010140",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2004801015,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2004801,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 15,
      "SpeakerName": "拉莫娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "全都是我自己想做才做的。我也没能说服任何人。/n最后引导大家的也是千寿历……就别向我道谢了。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20048010150",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 105,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 12,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 30203,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "302"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2004801016,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2004801,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 16,
      "SpeakerName": "拉莫娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "好了，你们也早点回去吧。/n我再练一会儿自己的内容就回去。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20048010160",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 103,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 15,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "302"
    },
    {
